      "text": "Athletics for All Abilities!\n\nAthletes of all para and intellectual abilities are welcome at Ngā Puna Wai Athletics Track. \n\nNo matter your experience or ability, come along and give athletics a go!\n\n📅 Starts Friday 23 October\n⏰ 4:00–5:00pm\n📍 Ngā Puna Wai Athletics Track\n👟 Primary & Secondary School children\n💰 $5 per session or $25 for 6 sessions\n\nThe programme runs through Term 4 and continues into Term 1.\n\nRegister via the link: https://forms.cloud.microsoft/Pages/ResponsePage.aspx?id=ZgaZvm_VaUC1OGDtOJJgn6VUdh5srt9NqBumf3kgjZFUQTdTTUw1RzVRS1lIVFNGUFU3VEEzMjJNOS4u\n\nor email Chloe.Roberts@athleticscanterbury.org.nz\n\nEveryone is welcome!",
