    "text": "Results are in. Congratulations teams:\n\n🥇 U16 Girls\n🥇 U12 Boys\n🥉 Masters Women, 50+\n4th Masters Men, 50+\n🥈 Masters Men, 35-49\n5th Masters Men, 35-49\n7th Senior Mixed \n\nhttps://athleticscanterbury.anet.live/meets/77836/events/relay/511633\n\nWhat a morning 🌅🏃‍♀️. The NCAN U16 girls team and The Good Trot social teams are underway at the Athletics Canterbury Road Relay Champs and have reached the top. Best wishes to all the teams out there. Special mention to the NCAN U12 team who're also running but turn around before the hill ⛰️\n\nThank you to Athletics Canterbury, the officials and volunteers who make these events happen.",
